  "_description": "Branch Manager activity generator config. Per banking convention, branch performance IS the Branch Manager's performance. PBT/NPL/PAR/CIR are the BM's OWN KPIs, not recursive aggregates from team. Mirrors v10.317 Teller / v10.327 Credit / v10.328 Support generator pattern.",
